<title>USA: Reynolds &amp; Reynolds issues $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Reynolds &amp; Reynolds issues $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Reynolds &amp; Reynolds Co was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER REYNOLDS &amp; REYNOLDS CO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.00	 MATURITY 12/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.51   FIRST PAY DATE 7/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.069 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 73 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
